(text "3.3 V  |  one piezo  |  gain 11/48 (JP1)  |  4-pole Butterworth ~15 kHz  |  ESP32-S3 ADC 80 kS/s or PCM1808 48 kS/s" (at 15.2400 22.8600 0) (effects (font (size 1.9558 1.9558)) (justify left top)) (uuid "709a557f-2bab-4db5-80b0-c0e274be5d6f"))
(text "Rev D vs Rev C: C1 removed (piezo blocks DC); BAV199 -> BAV99 (available in Baghdad); E24 filter values; R14 + JP1 gain select; C5 47p; separate DC (J3) and AC (J4) outputs." (at 15.2400 270.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.9558 1.9558)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1c37cde5-cbaf-460b-a7b4-266d13b1e1d0"))
